{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t到深圳出席亞太經合組織領導人非正式會議的行政長官李家超，今天在工商領導人峰會致辭。<br/>\n<br/>\n李家超表示，粵港澳大灣區是開放合作達致成果，最具說服力的例子之一，邀請各經濟體透過香港這個具有多項優勢的跳板，把握大灣區的龐大機遇。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T11:53:27.475774+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T11:39:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T00:16:15.463997+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T11:46:55.094131+00:00","content_hash":"d0a59fed2e2315583d08520b6354d0b1978aa7d3e3e2b1ed1fa94554072619c8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}